d Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 15 ft long inhabits Syl-Zed Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Selnela Monster","legend":"Locals say a relic monster of 9 ft long inhabits Selnela Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Vinnocrin Monster","legend":"Whispers say a relic monster of 9 ft long inhabits Vinnocrin Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Ovalcuthrilval Monster","legend":"Tales say a relic monster of 6 ft long inhabits Ovalcuthrilval Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Theleltheas Monster","legend":"Legends say a relic monster of 12 ft long inhabits Theleltheas Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Lylmethyr Monster","legend":"Tipplers say a relic monster of 11 ft long inhabits Lylmethyr Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Eerassad Monster","legend":"Rumors say a relic monster of 15 ft long inhabits Eerassad Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Ismelssad Monster","legend":"Legends say a relic monster of 10 ft long inhabits Ismelssad Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Seatonor Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 30 ft long."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Alboke Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 19 ft long."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Padsbuton Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 31 ft long."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Burpor Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 19 ft long."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Wazionter Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 41 ft long."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Albrigh Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 38 ft long."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Beham Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 27 ft long."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Worgenda Monster","legend":"Tales speak of a big Monster who inhabits Worgenda hills and eats kids whole."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Mathesle Beast","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a huge Beast who inhabits Mathesle hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker118","name":"Drardzir Banshee","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a fat Banshee who inhabits Drardzir hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker119","name":"Verahlisargola Beast","legend":"Legends speak of a giant Beast who inhabits Verahlisargola hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker120","name":"Uming Warg","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a proud Warg who inhabits Uming hills and steals cattle at night."},{"id":"marker121","name":"Brozunar Undead","legend":"Whispers speak of a horrifying Undead who inhabits Brozunar hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker122","name":"Lyarinolonan Banshee","legend":"Legends speak of a hungry Banshee who inhabits Lyarinolonan hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker123","name":"Undhellathyr Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Witnesses of Und."},{"id":"marker124","name":"Molanelkis Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Witnesses of Und."},{"id":"marker125","name":"Prorauhar Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Eldnaclugh Occultism."},{"id":"marker126","name":"Kuldralrund Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Eldnaclugh Occultism."},{"id":"marker127","name":"Sshaumyemar Cats","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker128","name":"Chand Spiders","legend":"A gang of mounted highwaymen."},{"id":"marker129","name":"Hlurthil Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker130","name":"Suirx Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Narkan Leopards","legend":"A gang of desert bandits."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Neecib Hares","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Driord Wolverines","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Ryeluguall Cats","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Ulalran Hyenas","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Efdolorelo Crows","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker152","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker153","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker154","name":"Stiolbog Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠿\udc28\udc37𐠅\ud802𐠄𐠈\ud802𐠘𐠖\udc1e\udc03\udc1c\udc26\udc10\udc18𐠲\udc1f 𐠱\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠈𐠄\udc22𐠍\ud802𐠞\udc1d\udc17𐠼\udc15𐠫\udc32\udc11\udc02\udc23 \ud802\ud802𐠧\udc3c\udc22\udc11𐠋\udc0f\udc2c\udc0b\udc3f\udc29\udc24\udc2c\udc16\udc2d\ud802\ud802 \udc15 \ud802 \udc25\udc34\udc27\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker155","name":"Iunemyeleth Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠱᡖᡯᠾᢋᠩᢛᠿᢒᠱᡞᢂᠯᢦᢡᡆᢛᠿᠠᠦᡖᡔᠳᡝᢤᠮᠪᠼᢑᡐᡴᡳᠿᡡᠵᡕᢋᠿᢑᡐᡞᡒᡱᠠᡝᡕᢞ᠑ᠩᢋᠾᡏ</div>"},{"id":"marker156","name":"Thyuethil Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢤᡙᠽᠦᡓᠰᡡ᠑ᠵᢡᡔ᠒ᡰᠯᠧᢑᠻᡆᢦᡑᢜᠦᡡ᠒ᢒᢑ᠐ᡆᡑᡞᡕᢛᡆᠮᠨ᠐ᡀᢡᠽᢓᡍᡭᠵ᠒ᡖᠠᡠᢥᠭᡞᡡ᠀᠀ᠿᠲᠿᢑᢟᡭᡠᡟᡗᢂᡮᢤᡱᢛᢛᡡᡠᠪᡝᡡᡴᢂᠪᢛ᠒ᠨᠾ</div>"},{"id":"marker157","name":"Hobok Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳬⳀⳘⳊ⳧ⳤⳊⳫⳚⳤⳁⳤⳞⳄ⳪ⳄⳒⳔⲶⳀⳔⳆ⳥ⳔⳔⳌ⳹ⳖⳒⳌⳐⳲⳐ⳥⳹ Ⳑ⳹ⳔⳚ⳹ⳂⳊⳖⲾ⳪Ⲹ⳩⳩ⳂⳂ⳹Ⳬ ⳂⳜⳊⳫⳂⲼ⳾ⳐⲶⳬⳜⳫⳲⳖⳭⳢ  ⳾Ⳅ⳹⳥ⳁⳚ ⳀⳔⲼⳒⳀⳄ⳧ⳭⲺⲼⳒⳆⳄⲾⲸⳢ</div>"},{"id":"marker158","name":"Capjer Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በከቀነ ጰሀዐየጸሰፈ ፐኀጠገአጠለወዐሰ  ሀ ዐገ   ቀሐቀጰጠነጰሠሀረጸዘፐቀነፈቀነሐከረ  ዘአነደዐዘከጰፈ</div>"},{"id":"marker159","name":"Slof Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸረፈተአቀመየ ሐጸጸደፐደሐጠሠ ነበረሰፈመአ ፀፀመገፐጸኀ መሠአአፈጠ ከጰፈዐ ሀሠጠነሰዘነኀ  ለፈአቀፈሰየ </div>"},{"id":"marker160","name":"Lefranbel Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡮᡆᠯᠧᠧᢠᡜ᠀ᢋᠭᢒᠯᡝᢋᢋᡳᠰᢢᠰᢜᠩᢥᠭᡱᠳᡱᡲᢞ᠐ᡑᠧᡟᢠᡡᠧᠳᠱᢠᢏᠮᠩ</div>"},{"id":"marker161","name":"Brybruing Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༿༓༊༛༥༇༌་༂༳༂༱༔༃༷ༀ༼༄༡༐༴༓༩༪༪་༙༱༛༿༇༒༗༅༶༦༜༩༃༦༒༻༆༂༊༯༨༣༊༄༌</div>"},{"id":"marker162","name":"Zar'thuphja Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳪ⳂⳎⳬⲲⳬⳢ ⲼⳢⲴⳐⳈⳆ⳧ⲲⳜⳲⳠⳆ⳾ⳜⳘⳜⲼⲲ⳾ⳬⳤ⳹ⳊⲾ⳾ⳌⳌⳐⳂⳀⲲⳞⳀⳲⳒ⳩Ⳟ ⳄⳖⳐⳔⳂⳤⳌⲶⳖⳢⲲⳞⳚⳭⳀⳫⳤⲲⲸⳆⳫⲴⳃⳌ ⳩ⳲⳫⳆ⳩ⳚⳄⳔⳄⳢⳒⳌ Ⲷ⳾ ⳤⳤ</div>"},{"id":"marker163","name":"Tsogt Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⲸⲸⳲⳤⳖ Ⳍ⳥⳥ⳁ Ⳮ Ⳣ⳩ⲸⲶⳘⲲⲸⳞⳂⳫⳖⳖⳒⳆ⳹Ⳅ ⳹ⲾⲶⳫⳘⳚ⳧ⳜⳒⳜ ⳂⲲⳢ⳾ⳄⳈⳀⳠⳤ Ⳅ⳹ ⳭⲼ⳥Ⲹ ⳒⳊⳁ⳪ⲲⳖⲴⳤ ⳬ⳥Ⳗ</div>"},{"id":"marker164","name":"Meveralalauth Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠየጸጰፐፐደዐአአጰጸመመገአተዘነሰ ተፈቀየ ሰቀነሠኀለ ኀሰየዐ ዘ  ፀየኀአፐከነጠደፈአፈሀሐቀሠአሠፐአረከዘገሀጠሠከፈበደፀሀደአነ</div>"},{"id":"marker165","name":"Eariondor Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༗༽༷༘༃༣༷༔༿༜༭༌༣༫༲༤༴༠༐༂༅༰༙༓༸༡ༀ༜༶༢༙༡༜༗༜༓༚༬༁༦༵༫༘༳ༀ༉</div>"},{"id":"marker166","name":"Enthadile Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰገወገለ ተበመ ጰዐመኀዘቀሠነደፐሰመለመ ሀየነነወወደተሰመፈለቀገጠነጸሐ ሠበ ረለሰጰሠከፈ ገፈረበደፐከተ አነሠፈሐከሠዐገ ነ ነፐረጸተጠጠተየጰአበዘየዘፈአነ ለ</div>"},{"id":"marker167","name":"Iunosaselion Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠨᠼᡲᢂᢓᠲᡀᢂᠮᡕᡁᠡᡜᡕᡐ᠒ᠻᢤᠻᡠᡐᠧ᠀ᠭᡜᡠᢤᡗᡏᠲ᠑ᡒᠿᡜᠿᠩᡒᡯᡝ᠐ᠪᠼᢁᡝᡝᡐᡁᡖᡲᠱᡆᡕᠽᠦᠾᡍᡀᡏᠵᢡᠱᡜᡴᢢᠵᡆᠵᡯᠯᢑᢤᡞᢤ</div>"},{"id":"marker168","name":"Khanza Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢤᠻᡴᢋᡎᢥᡝᡡᡖᠱᡴᢋᠰᢀᠲᢐᢂᢥᡖᡕᠮᠳᠰᡗᡙᡠᠭᠮᢏᠼᡲᢦᢀ᠀ᡏᡴᡮᢟᠻᡕᡠ᠑ᡕᡖᢀᡎᢢᡴᢛ᠀ᢏ</div>"},{"id":"marker169","name":"Oriathlashe Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༑༺༤༭༑ༀ༩༿༆༵༲ༀ༡༔༐༽༰༊༨༓༳༔༻༒༛༒༚༪༢༰༨༾༮༉༕༌༪༢༿༶༹༠༦༄༣༤༕༈༱༣༯༤༒༉</div>"},{"id":"marker170","name":"Ruthurras Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡙᡳᢟᠮᢡᢁᡐᡙᢜᢞᠳ᠒ᡡᢦᡭᡜᡴ᠑ᠯᢋᠧᢡᡔᠳᠿᡱᢑᠵᠠᠡᡔᢞᡙᡒᢥᠠᡴᢁᢀᢦᡑᡔᡓᢢᡒᡜᠿᠨᢁᢀᡍᢡᢥᠰᢁᢁᢑᢓᠿᠵᢀᠿᠩᢂ᠒ᠨᡠ</div>"},{"id":"marker171","name":"Aglensala-Jik Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲸⳚⳃⳬⳤⳆⲶⲲⲸⳭⳫⳒⳂ⳩ⳫⳘⳎⲴⳌⲶⳐⳒⳭⳃⳐⲶ⳪Ⳉⳃ⳧Ⳉⳬ⳪Ⳛ ⳈⳌⲴⲶⳃⳃⳀ⳩ⳢⲼⳫ⳹Ⳝ Ⳳ⳧Ⳉ⳧⳹Ⳍ⳧ⳀⳖⳊⳤⳐⳘ⳾Ⳋ⳧⳥ⳬ ⳲⳞ Ⲵ</div>"},{"id":"marker172","name":"Thil-Sinle Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈወዐወለ ፈተበወወመጠጸነገረሐነገሀፈሐጠዘሐተ ኀ ለረመከዘተዘወገገሐየቀጠ  ለ   ለቀመከ ኀቀ</div>"},{"id":"marker173","name":"Sshaumena Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳎⳬⲺⳒⳭⳈ ⳄⲲⳒⳌⳃⳲⳜⳠ ⳚⳠⳎⳃⳠⲶⳬⳘⲴⳐⳐ⳪ⳚⳒ ⲴⳆ ⳒⳲⳫⳌⳠⲲⲶⳒⲾⳆ</div>"},{"id":"marker174","name":"Jamnasthas Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢓᡗᢐ᠀᠐ᡟᡖ᠐ᡏᢥᠲᠵᠩᢤᠮ᠒ᢏᡓᠠᡱᠮᡞᠧᠽᡮᠦᡲᡏᠭᠱᢒ᠑ᡐᠳᠽᢜᢐᠮᢀᡴ᠀ᡟᡟᡑᡎᡎᡐᡆᢂᢥᢜᡕᢓᢑᠻᠻᠽ</div>"},{"id":"marker175","name":"Celx Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༛༒༲༓༭༧༖༫༖༗༡༵༥༅༿༃༌༹༘༾༖༯༦༠༇༢༤༺༚༐༖༣༾༪༸ༀ༓༩༑༑༐༕༔༾༤༈༷༺༲༻༿༐༺༼༅༦༭༮༧༂༿༕༢༧༐༢༼༳༕</div>"},{"id":"marker176","name":"Hloimye Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳭⳄⲺⳖ ⲶⲾ ⳪⳧ⳜⳠ⳹Ⲿ ⳥⳾ⳖⳜⳘⳐ⳧ⳈⳆⲶⳈ⳧ⳌⳞⳈⳲⳂⲸⲲⲲⳎⲴⳌⲸⳆⳬⳲⳌ⳧⳪Ⲵ⳥Ⳮ Ⳑ ⳃⳬⳫ⳥ Ⳃ⳥⳥ⳞⳖⳲⳫⳌⳄⳈ </div>"},{"id":"marker177","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker178","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker179","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker180","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker181","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker182","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker183","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker184","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker185","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker186","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie wit